OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse survivor warns
OL,4,A'look for red flags'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA domestic abuse survivor who was
OL,7,Femotionally and physically abused by
OL,8,Fher partner has urged other women to
OL,9,F"look for red flags" and not be afraid
OL,10,Fto speak to friends and family.
OL,12,FThe woman from Sussex, who cannot be
OL,13,Fnamed for legal reasons, told BBC South
OL,14,FEast how her then-partner showed
OL,15,Fcontrolling and coercive behaviour,
OL,16,Fincluding jealousy which "spiralled
OL,17,Finto emotional and physical abuse".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
