OL,3,GNEWSADomestic abuse survivor warns
OL,4,A'look for red flags'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on White Ribbon Day, Sussex
OL,7,FPolice has also urged women who are
OL,8,Fworried to make use of Clare's Law,
OL,9,Fwhich entitles them to know if their
OL,10,Fpartner or ex-partner has a history of
OL,11,Fviolence or abuse.
OL,13,FShe said: "I just knew that that wasn't
OL,14,Fthe place to be."
